{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wHm17Ceh8M1789708851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股先升後回。</p><p></p><p>科網股普遍向好，阿里巴巴先升後回，小米業績後升百分之4，京東更升半成。</p><p></p><p>不過晶片股受壓，中芯跌百分之3。華虹更急挫一成三，為表現最差藍籌。聯想集團也跌百分之8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.518888+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.818997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:16.682310+00:00","content_hash":"898dd1afe198d70fc2839ee9ec9f31d1985c20c5000995d5461bf4e92b3dd7cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.518888+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}